# Reference additions, 9 October 2026. Merge with existing matching site blocks;
# load each hostname once. Preserve unrelated edge configuration.
# Requires the existing utilibre_no_transform, utilibre_proxy_headers and
# utilibre_security_contact snippets and the edge's installed CrowdSec module.
# Do not replace the existing Caddyfile, site blocks, global options or TURN
# certificate-challenge route with this fragment.
#
# Uncommented application routes have deployed, tested backends.
# Newsletter and Addy web routes are installed; SimpleLogin remains private.
# PLANKA is excluded by its licence; the separate Projects fork has its own record.
# Do not expose a staged backend before its stated prerequisites pass.
# DNS for each hostname must resolve to the existing edge. HTTPS mail routes
# do not configure inbound SMTP, MX, aliases, signing or mail delivery.

(utilibre_new_app) {
    import utilibre_no_transform
    import utilibre_security_contact
    crowdsec
    encode zstd gzip
    reverse_proxy {args[0]} {
        import utilibre_proxy_headers
        transport http {
            dial_timeout 5s
            response_header_timeout 60s
        }
    }
}

# Spliit
expenses.utilibre.org {
    import utilibre_new_app http://10.10.1.43:3190
}

