# No new Caddy block for these static additions: the existing tools.utilibre.org
# upstream serves /apps/drawdb/, /apps/bookbinder/, /apps/sketchforge/,
# /apps/moodist/ and /apps/chartdb/. Application-side routing is deployed on
# this VM, not by changing the tools.utilibre.org edge site.
# URL Parameter Cleaner is live under /apps/link-cleaner/ on that host.
# The next batch also uses tools:3103: /apps/rustpad/, /apps/one-file-core/,
# /apps/tiddlywiki/ and /apps/moocup/. Their deployment records determine
# readiness; no additional edge block is required. See Caddyfile.everyday-additions.
# ZipCaptions is not deployed: its documented speech path is not verified local.
#
# Already-existing AudioMass, JupyterLite, RAWGraphs, RSS-Bridge, CyberChef,
# Reactive Resume, FMD and other running tools retain their current site blocks.

# AutoRedact, Knit, NewTon, Gravity and Kokoro Web also use the existing tools
# host: /apps/autoredact/, /apps/knit/, /apps/newton/, /apps/gravity/ and
# /apps/kokoro-web/. Their processing is in the browser. No new edge block.
